    "[COMMAND Initialize v as an empty list; for each vertex index from 0 to n-1 append an empty adjacency list to v. RESULT v]",
    "[COMMAND For each edge index i from 0 to m-1, read a and b from LI(), subtract 1 from both to convert to 0-based indices, append b to v[a] and a to v[b], increment f[a] and f[b], and set dic[(a,b)] = 1 and dic[(b,a)] = 1. RESULT graph_state]",
    "[COMMAND Within the while loop, if s is non-empty and len(s) is odd and d[x] is truthy, append (x,y) to ans for every y in s, set dic[(x,y)] and dic[(y,x)] to 0 for each y, and set d[x] to 0. RESULT oriented_edges]",
    "[COMMAND Within the while loop, if s is non-empty and len(s) is odd and d[x] is falsy, append (x,y) to ans for every y in s except the last y, set d[x] to 0, toggle d[last_y] with xor 1, append (last_y,x) to ans, and set dic[(x,last_y)] and dic[(last_y,x)] to 0. RESULT oriented_edges]"
